      "description": "Raw gas over the last 30 days ÷ feed over the same days (m³ per tonne), matching the 30-day digester retention time. Target = (100 m³/t × pressmud + 40 m³/t × cow manure) ÷ total feed. Days without a gas figure or a feed entry are left out; needs at least 20 days with data. Green at 80 % of target or more, amber 60–80 %, red below 60 %. Shows the latest day with statistics (normally yesterday; before the morning statistics run, the day before).",
